information, share ideas, and resolve issues;
Ability to communicate and interact professionally and tactfully with people of different levels of education, cultural backgrounds, and life experiences and to exhibit respect to others
Strong organizational skills and attention to detail, including the ability to adequately establish time
frames and deadlines, meet deadlines, and follow through on tasks and assignments
