The successful candidate will play a key role in ambitious digital services projects for learning and entertainment. They include diverse range of hardware and software platforms for multimedia content management and delivery to multiple devices such as connected TVs, set-top boxes, signage terminals, tablets and mobile phones. Established blue-chip customer base.
Key responsibilities
will include the following:
Closely working with Software, DevOps and Business teams to create the best possible system solutions for our customers;
