System design for high availability and mission critical services;
Hands-on design and deployment of on-premises, virtual and cloud infrastructure for customers;
Ongoing development and support of CombiTel’s cloud infrastructure;
Providing technology advice to company management;
Hands-on technical support to sales team and customers;
Closely working with 3rd party technology partners;
